  "description": "The EPIC 5 (#1136) payment-failure world, version 3 (the exit criterion 1 fixture): a payment charge/refund flow developed against a committed world — the PaymentGateway touchpoint declines (HTTP 402) the first two charge calls, times out (HTTP 504) on the third, and half-writes the first refund; the retry-with-backoff driver survives the window, the single-shot charge surfaces the honest red, and the partial refund is detected and repaired. `zfa simulate run --world=v3` proves the run deterministic.",
